OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment not helping Nepal
OL,4,Amanhunt, MP says
OL,5,
OL,6,FLavery asked for urgent talks on how
OL,7,Fthe government "can be more helpful to
OL,8,Fpeople who have lived in this country
OL,9,Fall their lives" but don't have
OL,10,Fcitizenship.
OL,12,FThe government said it was "in contact"
OL,13,Fwith Indian authorities regarding
OL,14,F"relief efforts".
